code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L29\">源码行 29</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>类型标识符的最大数量</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.linux.bpf.btf.max_vlen\"><h3><code>std.os.linux.bpf.btf.max_vlen</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L35\">源码行 35</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>函数参数中结构体、联合体或枚举成员的最大数量。</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.linux.bpf.btf.Member\"><h3><code>std.os.linux.bpf.btf.Member</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L122\">源码行 122</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>struct 和 union 种类之后跟随多个 Member 结构体；\n确切数量存储在 vlen 中。</p>\n</div>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>name_off: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>typ: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>offset: <span class=\"tok-kw\">packed</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>) {\n    bit: <span class=\"tok-type\">u24</span>,\n    bitfield_size: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>,\n}</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>若设置 kind_flag，则 offset 同时包含成员位域大小及\n位偏移；位域成员会设置位域大小。若类型信息中的\nkind_flag 未设置，则 offset 仅包含位偏移。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.linux.bpf.btf.Param\"><h3><code>std.os.linux.bpf.btf.Param</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L136\">源码行 136</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>func_proto 后跟多个 Param，确切数量存储于 vlen</p>\n</div>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>name_off: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>typ: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.linux.bpf.btf.std\"><h3><code>std.os.linux.bpf.btf.std</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">别名</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L1\">源码行 1</a></p>\n<p>别名目标 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.linux.bpf.btf.Type\"><h3><code>std.os.linux.bpf.btf.Type</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L37\">源码行 37</a></p>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>name_off: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>info: <span class=\"tok-kw\">packed</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">struct</span>(<span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>) {\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 结构体成员数量</span>\n    vlen: <span class=\"tok-type\">u16</span>,\n\n    unused_1: <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span>,\n    kind: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/os/linux/bpf/btf/#std.os.linux.bpf.btf.Kind\">Kind</a>,\n    unused_2: <span class=\"tok-type\">u2</span>,\n\n    <span class=\"tok-comment\">/// 由 Struct、Union 和 Fwd 使用</span>\n    kind_flag: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span>,\n}</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>size_type: <span class=\"tok-kw\">extern</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">union</span> { size: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span>, typ: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span> }</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>Int、Enum、Struct、Union 和 DataSec 使用 size 字段，它表示\n所描述类型的大小。</p>\n<p>Ptr、Typedef、Volatile、Const、Restrict、Func、\nFuncProto 和 Var 使用 type 字段；它是引用另一类型的 type_id。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.linux.bpf.btf.Var\"><h3><code>std.os.linux.bpf.btf.Var</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L155\">源码行 155</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>var 种类后跟单个 Var 结构体，描述与变量相关的\n额外信息，例如链接属性。</p>\n</div>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>linkage: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.linux.bpf.btf.VarLinkage\"><h3><code>std.os.linux.bpf.btf.VarLinkage</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L141\">源码行 141</a></p>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>static</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>global_allocated</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>global_extern</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.linux.bpf.btf.VarSecInfo\"><h3><code>std.os.linux.bpf.btf.VarSecInfo</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">容器</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L161\">源码行 161</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>datasec 类型之后跟随多个 VarSecInfo，用于描述其包含的所有 Var 类型，以及各自的节内偏移和大小。</p>\n</div>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>typ: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>offset: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>size: <span class=\"tok-type\">u32</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.os.linux.bpf.btf.version\"><h3><code>std.os.linux.bpf.btf.version</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">常量</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L4\">源码行 4</a></p>\n</section>\n<details class=\"source-code\" id=\"source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><summary>源码</summary><p><code>std/os/linux/bpf/btf.zig</code></p><div class=\"source-grid\"><pre class=\"line-numbers\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-copy-ignore=\"\"><code><a id=\"L1\" href=\"#L1\" tabindex=\"-1\">1</a>\n<a id=\"L2\" href=\"#L2\" tabindex=\"-1\">2</a>\n<a id=\"L3\" hre